# Note: results/ IS committed. The trained models, extracted features and
# figures are kept in the repo so demo_classifier.ipynb runs immediately on
# clone without a 10-minute feature extraction and training pass.
#
# The one exception is the ResNet18 checkpoint, at 43 MB against 13 MB for the
# largest committed pickle. It is a reference point rather than part of the
# classical pipeline, nothing in the demo touches it, and its scores are all
# committed as CSV, JSON and .npy. Run notebook 16 to regenerate it; notebook 17
# needs it and says so.
results/cnn_final_model.pt
